---
// The name, set in the machine's type: the dot of its i is one terminal cell, lit in the
// colour the screens' written cells glow with (--afterglow), crisp: glow stays on screens.
// The domain follows, dimmed, as `tty` followed `air` before.
---

<span class="wordmark" aria-hidden="true">luc<span class="i">ı<span class="cell"></span></span>ole<span class="tld">.sh</span></span>

<style>
  .wordmark {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .i {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Where the i's dot sits: a square cell, a monospace column wide at most. */
  .cell {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 0.06em;
    width: 0.26em;
    height: 0.26em;
    translate: -50% 0;
    background: var(--afterglow);
  }

  .tld {
    color: var(--mist);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
